mpt"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "prompt1", "link": 111, "label": "提示词1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt2", "link": 119, "label": "提示词2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt2"}, {"widget": {"name": "separator"}, "shape": 7, "name": "separator", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "间隔符"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptConcat", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [270, 78], "pos": [-1033.180419921875, 820.8810424804688], "id": 77, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptConcat"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [77], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "", "", 0.6000000000000001, 262898772, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 83, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 122, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 123, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "link": 124, "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 113, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [621.2294921875, 535.0810546875], "pos": [-753.407958984375, 525.9257202148438], "id": 56, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [118], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["**第一步：视觉解码与品牌分析 (Visual & Brand Analysis)**\n\n1.  **产品类目(Product_Category):** 硬核户外装备 / 专业功能性冲锋衣。\n2.  **视觉描述(Visual_Description):** 极简哑光黑色三层压胶冲锋衣，采用Gore-Tex专业防水透气面料。具有细腻的微磨砂质感，配备全防水压胶拉链，左胸口有精致的金属质感品牌Logo，袖口带有魔术贴调节带，整体剪裁符合人体工程学，线条硬朗且富有科技感。\n3.  **品牌调性(Brand_Vibe):** 极致专业、冷峻探索、高端机能、无惧风雨的意志感。\n4.  **目标模特(Target_Model):** 眼神坚毅、身材健硕的亚裔男性登山者，面部轮廓深邃，带着轻微的户外风霜感。\n5.  **理想场景(Ideal_Environment):** 暴雨将至的深色礁石海岸，或是云雾缭绕、冷冽的高海拔碎石荒漠。\n6.  **光影风格(Lighting_Style):** 低饱和度冷色调，高反差电影光，强调面料在潮湿环境下的质感反光。\n\n---\n\n**第二步：变量标准化 (Variable Definition)**\n\n*   **{THE_PRODUCT}:** A professional matte black Gore-Tex hardshell technical jacket, waterproof seam-sealed zippers, minimalist tactical design, high-performance outdoor fabric with subtle matte texture.\n*   **{THE_SCENE}:** Harsh alpine environment, dark jagged rocks, swirling mountain mist, dramatic storm clouds, moody and cold atmosphere.\n*   **{THE_MODEL}:** A fit Asian male explorer with a determined look, rugged facial features, wearing the technical jacket.\n*   **{THE_VIBE}:** Cinematic, high-contrast, moody atmosphere, cool blue and charcoal tones, 8k photorealistic, epic scale, sharp details.\n\n---\n\n**第三步：生成12张比例为16:9横屏的分镜图提示词 (Final Prompt Generation)**\n\n**选定叙事流派：4. 高能动态流 (The High-Energy Cut)**\n\n1.  **Wide Shot:** {THE_MODEL} standing alone on a jagged mountain peak, {THE_PRODUCT} contrasting against the grey {THE_SCENE}, epic scale, cinematic 16:9.\n2.  **Close-up:** Extreme detail of water droplets bead up and rolling off the waterproof fabric of {THE_PRODUCT}, high-speed photography, {THE_VIBE}, 16:9.\n3.  **Medium Shot:** {THE_MODEL} pulling up the hood of {THE_PRODUCT}, wind blowing mist across his face, intense gaze, {THE_SCENE}, 16:9.\n4.  **Low Angle Shot:** {THE_MODEL} trekking through heavy rain, the camera follows his boots and the hem of {THE_PRODUCT}, splashing water, high energy, 16:9.\n5.  **Extreme Close-up:** A gloved hand swiftly pulling up the waterproof zipper of {THE_PRODUCT}, focus on the precision engineering, {THE_VIBE}, 16:9.\n6.  **Dutch Angle:** {THE_MODEL} leaning against a dark rock during a storm, the wind whipping the fabric of {THE_PRODUCT}, dramatic lighting, 16:9.\n7.  **Macro Shot:** The metallic brand logo on the chest of {THE_PRODUCT}, glistening with moisture, shallow depth of field, {THE_VIBE}, 16:9.\n8.  **Action Shot:** {THE_MODEL} jumping over a rocky gap, {THE_PRODUCT} moving with his body, motion blur in the background {THE_SCENE}, 16:9.\n9.  **Close-up:** {THE_MODEL}'s profile, breath visible in the cold air, the high collar of {THE_PRODUCT} protecting his face, cinematic lighting, 16:9.\n10. **Abstract Shot:** A top-down view of rain hitting the shoulders of {THE_PRODUCT}, creating a rhythmic pattern of splashes, hyper-realistic texture, 16:9.\n11. **Tracking Shot:** Following {THE_MODEL} from behind as he walks into a thick wall of fog, the silhouette of {THE_PRODUCT} disappearing into {THE_SCENE}, 16:9.\n12. **Hero Shot:** {THE_MODEL} looking directly at the camera, rain-drenched but dry inside {THE_PRODUCT}, the storm raging behind him, final brand statement, 16:9."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 77, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [515.7622680664062, 871.8560180664062], "pos": [-126.02810668945312, 532.316162109375], "id": 59, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [60, 75], "label": "ima